msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "517192"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517224"
msgid "The void we're descending into is dark,\nbut somewhat warm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517284"
msgid "The twirling pattern seemed to be of flower petals.\nImages of flowers which could calm the mood of anyone\nwho sees them―the polar opposite to #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF's brutal claws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517472"
msgid "I don't like fighting.\nI don't like being scared.\nI don't want to get hurt anymore…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517560"
msgid "Please have fun talks with me.\nPlease show me a pretty world.\nPlease touch me, with gentle motions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517660"
msgid "If you could, don't chase after me.\nEveryone is so weak and frail.\nI just touch them once, and SMOOSH they go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517772"
msgid "…hrm. Hearing this voice of hers makes her\nsound like a delicate young girl, but…\nThat last phrase is a little disturbing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "517900"
msgid "Does #C236196003Passionlip#CDEF not understand?\nIt's not that the world is fragile,\nit's that she has too much strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518024"
msgid "Her delicate, naive voice makes you want to\npity her, but… if you hear it too many times,\nit WILL start sounding like a curse."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518152"
msgid "She breaks things she touches―things she loves\nnot because they're frail; it's because her\nclaws are far too brutal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518272"
msgid "Huh? I look like I'm in a very foul mood?\nNot at all.\nThis is simply hatred towards my own kind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518372"
msgid "This woman honestly thinks that if she endures,\neverything will turn out fine. As if we can't\nsee what's actually wrong here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518500"
msgid "When you end up destroying all that you touch,\nit just means that you're strange to the world.\nHer mistake is not accepting that fact."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518636"
msgid "I see, at last I comprehend―as to why her\npersonality heaps mountains of corpses.\nI've cleared away all doubt, mongrel."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518760"
msgid "She grieves of how fragile the world is,\nbut with those claws, she rends all that\nshe touches."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "518856"
msgid "All along, that #C000246204Alter Ego#CDEF was a lethal weapon\nwho was loathed by the world. She must\nbe the only one who can't realize that."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519000"
msgid "Please help me…\nWhen everyone sees me, their eyes bulge\nand their hands go up in the air."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519092"
msgid "Please forgive me…\nEveryone, EVERYONE,\nthey laugh at me, saying I'm bad."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519168"
msgid "#[He][She]# HAS to be different from the others.\n#[He][She]# looked at me with kindness.\n#[He][She]# spoke to me with a soft voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519300"
msgid "So kindly――!\nAnd, with a kind smile, like the one I saw over\nand over in my dreams, #[he][she]# asked me my name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519416"
msgid "I love #[him][her]#… I love #[him][her]#…\nI love #[him][her]#… I love #[him][her]#…\nI love #[him][her]#… I love #[him][her]#…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519552"
msgid "I knew it before we met.\nI loved #[him][her]# before we met.\nBut, once we finally did…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519640"
msgid "I really, REALLY came to love #[him][her]#!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519684"
msgid "My dream, the one I could only\nsee in my sleep, came true."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519744"
msgid "Yes, I love #[him][her]#,\nI love #[him][her]#,\nI love #[him][her]#…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519816"
msgid "Way, WAY more than anyone else, so much so that\nI'll pulverize anyone who comes between us――\nThat's how much I love #[him][her]#!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "519948"
msgid "…pardon me, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND.\nTechnically, I should be laughing off these\nrash remarks, calling them absurd, yet…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520080"
msgid "I cannot shame this voice―this love that wilts,\nlest it steals everything from its other.\nThat's how love felt for me as well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520208"
msgid "…that said, we need to defeat her.\nOne's love in such a form will only burn\ntheir lovers to ash. I know that all too well."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520332"
msgid "Don't get distracted, Master.\nHer displays of affection and kindness are no\nindication that she's on your side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520444"
msgid "This confession is a choice, \"one\" or \"zero.\"\nDevote your all or she'll kill your all. Hers is\na cruel goddess' love of absolute portrayal."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520584"
msgid "Only, YOU'RE getting pulverized. I might be one\nto talk when sizing up others, but as her\nprecursor, I'll say this much:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520708"
msgid "This one has way too much #ROFS-002#RUBS  baggage#RUBEpassion#REND for my tastes.\nShe should come back after shaving a few #ROFS-001#RUBS  cups#RUBEclaws#REND.\nMaybe then she'll develop a proper spine."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "520912"
msgid "Ha! Quite the passionate confession, no?\nCharmed her down to the very bone, lady-killer.\nDid you two hit it off in secret earlier?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521044"
msgid "Alas, what awaits you now is no bed,\nbut a battlefield. Do you have what it takes\nto judge the one who pines for you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521164"
msgid "They would laugh and say, \"You're a monster.\"\n\"You're just a filthy animal!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521244"
msgid "That's why #[he][she]# is my Prince Charming.\nI just know #[he][she]#'ll be kind to me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521336"
msgid "I just know it.\nFor one, #[he][she]# would come to me with\na flower that I like very much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521428"
msgid "Then #[he][she]# would get close and tell me not to cry;\n#[he][she]# would wipe my tears, holding out the\nflower… Then, #[he][she]# would take my hand, and…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521588"
msgid "…then, #[he][she]# would take my…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521628"
msgid "#[He][She]# wouldn't take my hand.\n#[He][She]# wouldn't hold my hand."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521700"
msgid "#[He][She]# looked at me like I was someone scary,\nsomeone unpleasant, someone #[he][she]# hates."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521800"
msgid "I still really like you, though.\nI still love you, though!\nSo――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521868"
msgid "Even if I die, even if you kill me,\neven if I'm hated all over for it,\nI'll NEVER let you get away!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "521968"
msgid "You're my Prince and mine alone.\nI promise you this:\nI'll take good care of you. Forever…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522060"
msgid "Wouldn't you like to #ROFS0003#RUBS die#RUBElive#REND on forever,\nsafe inside of my #ROFS-001#RUBStrash bin#RUBEchest#REND?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522184"
msgid "I won't let anyone come between us anymore.\nI won't let anyone else have you――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522268"
msgid "I really like you. I really like you.\nI really like you. I really like you.\nI really like you. I really like you…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522384"
msgid "I can't tell if her subconscious voice\nsings the ode of an earnest love\nor the dirge of an obsessive mental break."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "522500"
msgid "This course must be coming to an end soon."
msgstr ""

